Mc-sHg543X2Z-tpyG3TaFiqGH4_hUw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE4h1lfyM1OiJ-ER3XY4JyCd9z3c7JKhPymM1FX73p64Q&oe=6A7DAAC0"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-104346.png", "id": "1910051799596938", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1910051802930271_5093697632380196663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQ5A2LkLRCcQ7kNvwF38zB1&_nc_oc=AdpfVojrFWpJLvr_iushgGOKvkUHGj9RYji2N-a7ZJ0hiGfLaV_oUzxUAMG-CbCBTT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF-X_xRNyFFR_crYa-wM00mhm1esbysgrG2WtAvAi6CHg&oe=6A7DBE1B"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-103557.png", "id": "1406115264546505", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1406115267879838_2631368577935749496_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cyZQwkQtHIAQ7kNvwFurv7-&_nc_oc=Adpr5CkuyibOaI0k86UdoRkTYXvwgsowXqHd0JnKtUdaDsQ14xXmovb0zO9EqnXuyhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1csNiCHj9WpzrqftztJLz1735IYsS9PthbxsfQFxkeg&oe=6A7DA5AD"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-111655.png", "id": "911517787897938", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_911517791231271_4588332304987211788_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1N_oc_LqYr0Q7kNvwEKhlgA&_nc_oc=AdqQaj0emEEQk7SXrULAI3VU1oDuyYrTZAskfYeBgxhcfG7hVkuvhIPcOJs-ciNvcls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFYu9Bq414B-7qnOF6lQPIOo81iE9ZiiMeJXLxPnYpI4Q&oe=6A7DB69A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-07-18-14h53m09s181.png", "id": "24523165587385059", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_24523165607385057_3752300522125326141_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WVgB9VFYFo0Q7kNvwEy93zR&_nc_oc=Adrst65JJgQC9Ruy-w_iht1Qh3NnQ0KIX_hqmqGV7g7cdjnvARHuDfnQ7fM6Xz5oF8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF5afF-2Y-oJXJY9ntarCL-C0als0ciOpA7iYtPlkKElQ&oe=6A7DC940"}, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "stealth", "survival", "scary", "psychological"], "long_description": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n# WHY YOU WILL FEAR THE DARK:\n\n- **Ever-Changing Nightmare:** Item locations and scares are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n- **Scoring Mode:** Beat your high score and test your stealth and survival skills in a franatical collecting run!\n- **Hard Story Mode:** You know all the tricks and locations but want a bigger challenge? Try the unforgiving hard mode and test your skills even more!", "short_description": "Find and collect items that tell a dark story in an abandoned log cabin, but watch out for what lurks behind you. You sneak through dark rooms against a relentless, adaptive creature. Forget combat\u2014patience and stealth are your only mission. Experience a dynamic world with randomized item locations and a reactive environment. Evade the guardian as it reacts to noise and hunts you. Piece by piece, reveal the chilling past and examine items in your personal safe room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Glock Software", "s